%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Act2_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c87e7bff18f0c8b4ea7bab914586b77c, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1169154048
    m_Localized: Lice. Death. Infection. As if there weren't enough reminders.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097088
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097089
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097090
    m_Localized: I can't get through here anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097091
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097092
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097093
    m_Localized: This isn't the shortest way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097094
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097095
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097096
    m_Localized: A new sheet every day. But no fewer dead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097097
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097098
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097099
    m_Localized: Military compound. Entry by permit only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097100
    m_Localized: Soldier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097101
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097102
    m_Localized: The hospital is closed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097103
    m_Localized: Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097104
    m_Localized: Yes, that was the last handout today. What do you need?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097105
    m_Localized: Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097106
    m_Localized: I told you, that was the last handout. We're out of firewood. Now,
      goodb...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097107
    m_Localized: Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097108
    m_Localized: What else? I've already told you everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097109
    m_Localized: Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097110
    m_Localized: Well, congratulations. You'll have new neighbours. You'll just have
      to squeeze in...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097111
    m_Localized: Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097112
    m_Localized: What wife? What child? They shouldn't be moving anyone in if you
      have a family.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097113
    m_Localized: Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097114
    m_Localized: Ah, I see. What do you want from me? To register your wife and child
      at your house? I can't do that. You need to see the officials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097115
    m_Localized: Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097116
    m_Localized: There are documents like that. They're issued to officials and medical
      staff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097117
    m_Localized: Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097118
    m_Localized: The ones who transport the dead? That must be hard...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097119
    m_Localized: Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097120
    m_Localized: I'd like to help, but I can't issue you one. I gave out the last
      one. We won't get any more until next week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097121
    m_Localized: Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097122
    m_Localized: I'm afraid I can't help. The last document went to the orderly who
      left just before you arrived. He took the last of the firewood, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097123
    m_Localized: Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097124
    m_Localized: Just now. You might even have seen him as you came up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097125
    m_Localized: Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097126
    m_Localized: That's enough. I don't have time to talk. I have rounds to do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097127
    m_Localized: Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097128
    m_Localized: But you just gave someone firewood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097129
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097130
    m_Localized: Some firewood...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097131
    m_Localized: Wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097132
    m_Localized: They're going to move people into my house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097133
    m_Localized: But they can't. I have a wife and child...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097134
    m_Localized: They... They aren't registered as living there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097135
    m_Localized: I heard there's a document you can get to stop them moving people
      in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097136
    m_Localized: I'm a cart driver with the sanitary unit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097137
    m_Localized: I'd like one of those documents, so they won't move anyone into
      my house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097138
    m_Localized: But they told me they're moving people in two days from now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097139
    m_Localized: When did he leave?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097140
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097141
    m_Localized: What is that... Who is that... I need to get home, quickly!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097142
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097143
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097144
    m_Localized: Give me a hand, will you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097145
    m_Localized: Medic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097146
    m_Localized: Help
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097147
    m_Localized: I've never seen that orderly before...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097148
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097149
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097150
    m_Localized: Good evening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097151
    m_Localized: Orderly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097152
    m_Localized: I'm sorry, I'm in a hurry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097153
    m_Localized: Orderly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097154
    m_Localized: What about my house?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097155
    m_Localized: Orderly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097156
    m_Localized: Well... They were going to... But I got a document.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097157
    m_Localized: Orderly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097158
    m_Localized: Why won't you leave me alone? I'm in a hurry. Goodbye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097159
    m_Localized: Orderly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097160
    m_Localized: Evening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211097161
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291392
    m_Localized: Your house...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291393
    m_Localized: Are they moving people in?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291394
    m_Localized: What document?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291395
    m_Localized: Damn it, I need to catch him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291396
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291397
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291398
    m_Localized: I can't leave Novonikolayevsk. My wife, my child, my work, my life
      are all here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291399
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291400
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291401
    m_Localized: Oh, thank you. Could you hand it over?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291402
    m_Localized: Medic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291403
    m_Localized: Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291404
    m_Localized: I have a bad feeling about this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291405
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291406
    m_Localized: Enter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291407
    m_Localized: The log rolled away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291408
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291409
    m_Localized: Take
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291410
    m_Localized: Now she's with her family forever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291411
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291412
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291413
    m_Localized: The chapel is closed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291414
    m_Localized: Soldier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291415
    m_Localized: I said, the chapel is closed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291416
    m_Localized: Soldier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291417
    m_Localized: What about them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291418
    m_Localized: Soldier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291419
    m_Localized: Yes, there are houses like that. The owners get a special document,
      and no one is moved in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291420
    m_Localized: Soldier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291421
    m_Localized: I don't know. I think you have to be an official, or an orderly,
      or someone else from the hospital.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291422
    m_Localized: Soldier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291423
    m_Localized: You transport the bodies?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291424
    m_Localized: Soldier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291425
    m_Localized: Must be hard, seeing so many dead people?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291426
    m_Localized: Soldier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291427
    m_Localized: '"He says nothing."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291428
    m_Localized: Soldier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291429
    m_Localized: If you're with the sanitary unit, go to the hospital. You might
      be entitled to one of those documents.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291430
    m_Localized: Soldier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291431
    m_Localized: I wanted to ask you something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291432
    m_Localized: That's not what I mean. I mean the houses they're moving people
      into.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291433
    m_Localized: I heard some houses are exempt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291434
    m_Localized: How do you get it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291435
    m_Localized: I work as a cart driver with the sanitary unit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291436
    m_Localized: Yes...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291437
    m_Localized: It depends... Sometimes it's better to see the dead than the living
      who are barely alive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291438
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291439
    m_Localized: Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291440
    m_Localized: He died a few days ago.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291441
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291442
    m_Localized: It was night. I only saw him in the morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291443
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291444
    m_Localized: By morning he was already frozen to the ground...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291445
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291446
    m_Localized: Now all we can do is wait for the thaw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291447
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291448
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291449
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291450
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291451
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291452
    m_Localized: What was that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291453
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291454
    m_Localized: Were they alive?...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291455
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291456
    m_Localized: I don't know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291457
    m_Localized: Once...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291458
    m_Localized: '"He mumbles incoherently."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291459
    m_Localized: Orderly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291460
    m_Localized: Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291461
    m_Localized: I can't help you any further...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291462
    m_Localized: Soldier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291463
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291464
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291465
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291466
    m_Localized: I...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291467
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291468
    m_Localized: Killed...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291469
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291470
    m_Localized: Him...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291471
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291472
    m_Localized: Was there no other way?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291473
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291474
    m_Localized: Now I need to...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291475
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291476
    m_Localized: Yes... I need to take the document.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291477
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291478
    m_Localized: I...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291479
    m_Localized: Killed...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291480
    m_Localized: Him...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291481
    m_Localized: I had to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291482
    m_Localized: There was no other way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291483
    m_Localized: Take the document
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291484
    m_Localized: Search
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291485
    m_Localized: I don't need to go there right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291486
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291487
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291488
    m_Localized: I need to go home now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291489
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291490
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291491
    m_Localized: I'd better leave her alone...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291492
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291493
    m_Localized: She's lost everyone...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291494
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291495
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291496
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291497
    m_Localized: A log... There's frozen blood on it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291498
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291499
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291500
    m_Localized: It can't be him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291501
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1215291502
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6797910016
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6797910017
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
